# Cloudflare Pages _redirects for the alignedwithheaven.net project.
# Ship in the same deploy as the new routes. Keep in sync with redirects.json and README.
#
# SCOPE NOTE (important):
# Cloudflare Pages _redirects cannot match on hostname, so rules here apply to
# EVERY domain attached to this project (alignedwithheaven.net, and any second
# domain added). Rules that would collide with Site A's own routes (e.g. "/")
# are therefore NOT included here. Site B's root redirect lives in
# deploy/_redirects.therealityofdeath.com — see README → "Cutover".

# ── SITE A — alignedwithheaven.net (GoDaddy → new Astro routes) ──────────────
/shop                      /store/                                                           301
/shop/                     /store/                                                           301
/shop/ols/products         /store/                                                           301
/shop/ols/all              /store/                                                           301
/shop/ols/categories/evangelism-tools  /store/                                               301
/shop/ols/products/365-days-to-becoming-a-supernatural-teacher  /books/365-days-to-becoming-a-supernatural-teacher/  301
/shop/ols/products/texting-with-the-king-phone-size  /store/texting-with-the-king-phone-size/  301
/shop/ols/products/texting-with-the-king-computer-size  /store/texting-with-the-king-computer-size/  301
/f/what-to-think-about-the-results-of-the-2026-elections  /blog/what-to-think-about-the-results-of-the-2026-elections/  301
/f/*                       /blog/:splat                                                      301
# Legacy feed URLs are intentionally NOT redirected — the same URLs are regenerated by this build.
# Legacy sitemaps → Astro sitemap index
/sitemap.xml               /sitemap-index.xml                                                301
/sitemap.website.xml       /sitemap-index.xml                                                301
/sitemap.blog.xml          /sitemap-index.xml                                                301
/sitemap.ols.xml           /sitemap-index.xml                                                301

